## Working rules

- Convert anything that must happen every time with zero exceptions into a hook instead of prose; keep everything else here minimal.
- State one canonical rule per topic; do not leave two rules that might contradict.

Strip the `.template` suffix when you copy this file into your project; place it at `AGENTS.md`, not `AGENTS.md.template`.

Before copying, check this repository's [adapters/README.md](../adapters/README.md) for tool-specific differences (Codex, Copilot, Gemini CLI, Cursor, ...). This sentence describes this repository's own layout, not yours — delete it once you copy the file.

